The core agent-decisions template written outside a Claude Code session: the session macro prints
nothing, so `session` is null; `artifact` keeps the vault-relative path it was given.

-- cmd --
booping create core.agent_decisions.template agent-decisions --set name=20261018-120000-present --set step=groom/present --set asked="Approve the plan?" --set decision=approved --set why="the plan matches the request" --set artifact=plans/p/index.md --stub-macro core.macros.date=2026-10-18
-- exit --
0
